testdata/analyzer_neg/origin_setcookie_resp_param.sober:7:12: error: the cache policy 'Revalidate' lets a shared cache store the response, and Set-Cookie (a server.SetCookie value, built in main.withCookie) is in the same route or response. A shared cache would store the cookie with the response and give it to other users (language.md 12 節「出所の依存」). Use server.Private / server.NoStore here, or return the cookie from a route without a stored cache policy (Analyzer)
